# Frontend agent context

Before frontend work, follow the repository authorities:

- `../RULES.md` for safety, boundaries, spec gate, validation, and reviews.
- `../AGENTS.md` for workflow and skill routing.
- `../.opencode/agents/frontend-implementer.md` for frontend ownership and
  implementation guidance.
- `../DESIGN.md` for visual design decisions.

Frontend consumes backend APIs and must not depend on MongoDB collection
shapes. Follow the existing Vue/TypeScript patterns and run focused tests when
applicable, followed by lint and build.
